sequenceDiagram
  actor User
  participant UI as RouteSearchUI
  participant NM as NavigationManager
  participant LT as LocationTracker
  participant GC as GeofenceChecker
  User->>UI: "이 경로로 안내" 선택
  UI->>NM: new NavigationManager(route)
  NM->>LT: startTracking()
  loop 위치 갱신마다
    LT-->>NM: onLocationUpdate(location)
    NM->>GC: checkDistance(cur, alightStation)
    GC-->>NM: distance
    NM->>NM: updateProgress()
    NM-->>User: 현재 위치/남은 정류장 수 갱신
  end
